Package: gl-ai-agent
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GL-AI Agent contributors
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc, lua, uci, libubus-lua
Description: GL-AI助手 - natural-language configuration agent for the native
 GL.iNet SDK4 admin panel. Adds an AI assistant page that turns plain-language
 requests into real router changes through the SDK's own RPC layer, with a
 confirmation gate, change preview and audit journal. Injects a page into the
 stock admin UI; does not touch LuCI.
